<title>FRANCE: Paribas unit buys 13 pct of Opta.</title>
<headline>Paribas unit buys 13 pct of Opta.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nouvelle Holding Guyomar'ch (NHG), a wholly unit unit of Paribas Affaires Industrielles, said on Thursday that it had acquired a 12.7 percent stake in U.S. agro-technology firm Opta Food Ingredients.</p>
<p>NHG said in a statement that the share purchase made it Opta's biggest shareholder. Opta, which generates around $10 million in annual sales, is specialised in enzyme modification and other technology used in agro-industry.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
